#   - emit 0
#   - emit 0
# provenance: targeted (round 3): TU-4 (proposed) over a one-axis value is N-9: a left fold in index order (1e16 + 1 rounds back to 1e16, so the result is 0; any other order gives 2). The par loop over 4 contributions has tree ((a+b)+(c+d)) here, which also gives 0; holds under the adopted rules today
